{"server":"cn","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_03_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_03","title":"7:22P.M.","storyCode":"CB-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"5da63fdbad5fcbf5a561e0fa2ca097e2484f19226b296b9eec242928992a50c1","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊——都这个点了......赶紧回去睡觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，如果在这里开个海鲜摊，这客流量可真不得了啊。唔？那是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"喂~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"休想得逞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，是我啊，放手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"什么嘛，你怎么在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......收摊回家的路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你在这里发呆——不对，立刻就能反手擒拿好像也不算在发呆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你听说刚才在立交桥上发生的车祸了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不是应该在复习功课吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"劳逸结合，不然明天拿到试卷的时候脑袋一白就完蛋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才好像听客人提到过，但愿没有伤亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......但我在事务所听说，这事儿和一群不干不净的家伙有关系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"先说好，我绝对和什么杀手、帮派之类的没有关系，你知道的对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你的事情大家早就清楚了——不如说你总是这幅态度，不被怀疑才奇怪吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......是喔，难怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"而且两个小时前还在龙门边郊的高速公路上发生了一起瓦斯爆炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"高速公路上，瓦斯爆炸？这个理由也太滥用了点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。你该不会想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了嘛，劳逸结合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，就知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"但这算劳还是逸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了吧，再怎么说这里也是市中心，他们不可能行动自如。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才点的是抹茶味的？那这份是你的，我请客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"的确没看见什么可疑的家伙，可......我们是不是太悠闲了点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"什么话，这可是五星推荐，比黑手党厉害多了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你能联系得到德克萨斯他们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"不能，事出突然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，那就更不着急了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你的冰淇淋要化了喔，别这么紧张兮兮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我只是......谁能料到事情会变成现在这样。我是应该冷静一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"黑手党们千里迢迢从叙拉古来到龙门，总不会只是为了参加安魂节狂欢吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们有别的目的，其中之一，是我。但是更具体的，我还不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"敌明我暗，既然已经摆脱了追击，应该利用单独行动的优势调查事态的因果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们该怎么入手？应该找机会进行反追踪吗？不，还是应该优先和德克萨斯小姐取得联系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，比起德克萨斯他们，你倒是更像个普通的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，突然就开始自说自话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你说的没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我们都知道黑手党另有目的，的确不该轻举妄动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"只是偶尔也要相信一下德克萨斯她们，别看他们总是那样，企鹅物流可是很强的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然用“强”来形容一个物流公司有点奇怪，嗯......算啦，反正我也没资格抱怨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我们一边逛街，一边看看风景，等见到德克萨斯的时候，他们已经把敌人一网打尽了喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，是这样吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"看见那家糖果店了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"与其说店，更像一个摊铺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，有些年头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"很多年前我刚来龙门的时候就来过这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那个时候呀......身上也没有龙门币，说实话，灰头土脸的，倒是一眼就被糖果吸引了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"是......这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"只是单纯的长途跋涉，路上遇到了一点小麻烦。信使都是这样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我们去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇！是彩色的星星！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷，你为什么能把星星摘下来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是秘密了，可不能随随便便告诉你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这哪里是星星，不就是加了色素的水果糖嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，可是这么好看的糖果真的很少见诶......你不想要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啰、啰嗦！喂！有棉花糖吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有，怎么没有，来，伸手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"诶——但比起这点棉花糖，我还是想要那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我讨厌吃水果糖！太甜了！而且舌头会变成奇怪的颜色！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想要的话就一并拿去吧，难得的安魂夜，就不收你们钱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么晚了，赶紧回家睡觉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢爷爷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别鞠躬啦！快去那边的玩具店看看！安魂夜限定骑士哎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在的孩子们真有活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们也要买点什么吗？维多利亚进口的水果软糖，附赠安魂夜蜡烛装饰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不着急，老先生。长夜漫漫，今晚才刚刚开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊，说的也是。你们这样的年轻人，一定会去参加闹市狂欢的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（莫斯提马小姐，这位是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......老先生也会参加今晚的活动吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能呢，我已经是把老骨头了，但我的糖果会代替我参加的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"今年的狂欢盛典很特别吗？似乎还有一些外宾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这座城市在先前的岁月里沉寂太久了，人们的确需要一个像样的狂欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然是狂欢，有更多的客人参与进来，发生各种各样的事情，不是也很有趣吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"的确，是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安魂夜本来就是为了送走那些亡魂，活着的人能够开开心心，就是最好的祭奠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的不买点什么吗？当年你可是在橱窗外头看入神了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你还记得，真有点不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，怎么记不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"可是很遗憾，工作之前吃太多甜食可不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是吗......那一路走好，年轻人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了有空回来看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"狂欢吗，号称是龙门这么多年来最盛大的一次节日活动呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......拜松？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我在想事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"在这种情况下，你会想到什么显而易见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你太喜欢思考了，偶尔也要以直觉行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"直觉......莫斯提马小姐这样的信使，也会相信直觉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"更确切地来说，是随机应变吧。比如，我们现在正站在桥上，而下面有通行的小货船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，前后各有三名乔装打扮好的黑手党成员，正在慢慢向我们靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"想伪装已经迟了，他们早就盯上我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"从刚才的糖果铺那里开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我们被包围了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"这附近都是游客，我们不能在这里大打出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但是很遗憾，对方似乎没有这种顾虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"跳下去，现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"从桥上——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说你太喜欢思考了，跳过栅栏，纵身一跃，就这样——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等一下——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"噗哈！总觉得今天不是第一次自由落体......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......糖果？为什么要用船运糖果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们总算甩开他们了，莫斯提马——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["莫斯提马"]},{"speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","aliases":["槐琥"]},{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
